sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant SS as SubscriptionService
    participant CS as CatalogService
    participant W as Worker
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant P as Publisher
    participant N as NATS
    participant CN as Consumer
    participant M as Mailer

    Note over C,M: Subscribe
    C->>H: POST /api/subscribe
    H->>SS: Subscribe(email, repo)
    SS->>CS: Ensure(owner/name)
    CS->>GH: CheckRepo(owner/name)
    GH-->>CS: 200 / 404 / 429
    CS->>DB: upsert repository
    SS->>DB: insert subscription (pending)
    SS->>P: SendConfirmation(email, token)
    P->>N: publish notifications.confirmation
    H-->>C: 200 OK
    N-->>CN: deliver
    CN->>M: SendConfirmation(email, token)

    Note over W,M: Release notification — every 25 s
    W->>CS: ListTracked
    CS->>DB: query repositories
    DB-->>CS: []Repository
    CS-->>W: []Repository
    loop each repository
        W->>GH: GetLatestTag(owner/name)
        GH-->>W: tag / not found
        alt new tag
            W->>CS: UpdateLastSeenTag(repoID, tag)
            W->>SS: ListConfirmedByRepositoryID(repoID)
            SS->>DB: query confirmed subscriptions
            DB-->>SS: []Subscription
            loop each subscriber
                W->>P: SendReleaseEmails(recipients, release)
                P->>N: publish notifications.release
                N-->>CN: deliver
                CN->>M: SendRelease(email, token, tag)
            end
        end
    end
